summary:
  The Automation page offers Auto-care while the delay is set by ear.

history:
  With "Set the delay by ear" on, the engine runs no automatic check and
  the output menu does not offer the box. Up to 2026.43 the settings page
  still did: it could be ticked there and nothing happened. 2026.44 greys
  the box, says why, and leaves the stored choice as it is.

target:
  package/contents/ui/config/configAutomation.qml

find:
              enabled: !root._byEar

replace:
              enabled: true

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_automationpage.qml::test_tuning_by_ear_switches_the_box_off_and_says_why
  and tests/qml/tst_automationpage.qml::test_a_choice_made_before_is_shown_and_kept.
  Line-neutral.
